-\end{tabular}
-\end{table}
-
-Independent Gaussian noise is added to the observed modal positions and
-velocities at $0.1\%$ and $0.5\%$ of each coordinate's training standard
-deviation, with dimensionless floors $10^{-4}$ for $X$ and $10^{-5}$
