+ &\quad+B[\sinh(ks)-\sin(ks)].
+ \label{sm:characteristic-shape}
+\end{align}
+The undamped endpoint conditions for this eigenproblem are
+\begin{align}
+ EIw_{sss}(L)+m_t\omega^2w(L)&=0,\nonumber\\
