-$\sqrt{\lambda_N}\|\Delta c\|_2\leq r_N+t_N$.
-Finally,
-$\|\sum_j\Delta c_j\psi_j-R\|_{\mathcal X}
-\leq K_{\mathcal X}\|\Delta c\|_2+\varepsilon_R$ by Cauchy--Schwarz.
-\end{proof}
