- d&=\left(\frac{4065323231059343}{18014398509481984},
-          \frac{2898505962069547}{9007199254740992}\right).
- \end{aligned}
- \label{eq:certified-beam-parameters}
-\end{equation}
-The target uses $a=1$ and zero quartic residual in
